\par\par \b \uc2 News Highlights: Top Equities Stories of the Day\b0\par\par\uc2 901 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 Oktober 2015\par 19:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par TOP STORIES \par  \par U.S. TRADE GAP WIDENS SHARPLY \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The U.S. trade gap widened sharply in August, suggesting trade will weigh on economic growth in the third quarter as a strong dollar and a slowdown overseas curb demand for U.S.-made goods. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par GLOBAL STOCKS LOSE MOMENTUM \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A selloff in health-care stocks deepened in midday trading Tuesday, threatening to overshadow a crude-oil rally that lifted energy stocks. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2  DOWNGRADES GLOBAL ECONOMIC OUTLOOK AGAIN \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2  once again downgraded its outlook for global growth, hurt by a slowdown in emerging markets. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par GM DOES U-TURN IN IGNITION-SWITCH MOTION \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 General Motors\f28 \uc2 \f2  withdrew a court motion in a lawsuit involving a defective ignition switch after a plaintiff's lawyer claimed it violated the terms of a September criminal settlement with the \f28 \uc2 \f2 U.S. Justice Department\f28 \uc2 \f2 . \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 VOLKSWAGEN\f28 \uc2 \f2  TO CUT BACK ON INVESTMENT, STEP UP COST-CUTTING \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Volkswagen\f28 \uc2 \f2  will cut back investments and costs as it grapples with the fallout from its emissions scandal. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par GLOBAL OIL TO CUT SPENDING BY $130 BILLION, \f28 \uc2 \f2 OPEC\f28 \uc2 \f2  SAYS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Global oil investments are set to be slashed by a staggering $130 billion this year, crimping supplies and ultimately boosting prices, \f28 \uc2 \f2 OPEC\f28 \uc2 \f2 's chief said, and added that he was open to discuss the current oil market turmoil with the U.S. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par U.S., RUSSIA AGREE TO MORE TALKS OVER AIR \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 OPERATIONS\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  IN SYRIA \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The U.S. and Russia have agreed to hold more talks aimed at reducing chances that their air \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  over Syria will end in a confrontation between the two powers, U.S. officials says. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par FORMER BROKERS STAND TRIAL OVER LIBOR \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Six former brokers with nicknames including "Lord Libor" and "Big Nose" helped convicted bank trader Tom Hayes rig interest rate benchmarks for financial reward, a London court heard on the first day of a criminal trial. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par EU COURT STRIKES DOWN TRANS-ATLANTIC DATA-TRANSFER PACT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The EU's highest court on Tuesday struck down a trans-Atlantic data pact used by thousands of companies to transfer Europeans' personal data to the U.S., a decision that will ripple through businesses such as online advertising and cloud computing. The ruling was a victory for privacy advocates. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 PEPSICO\f28 \uc2 \f2  PROFIT FALLS ON VENEZUELAN IMPAIRMENT CHARGES \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 PepsiCo\f28 \uc2 \f2  said its third-quarter profit plunged after the snack-and-beverage giant booked a massive charge to write down its Venezuelan business. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par IBM CEO SAYS AUTOMATION WON'T DECIMATE JOB MARKET \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The evolution of thinking machines will lead to big changes in the way people work, IBM CEO \f28 \uc2 \f2 Virginia Rometty\f28 \uc2 \f2  said Tuesday at the Gartner Symposium. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par U.S. GENERAL SAYS STRIKE ON HOSPITAL WAS A MISTAKE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The commander of U.S. and coalition forces in Afghanistan told senators that the U.S. mistakenly targeted a \f28 \uc2 \f2 Doctors Without Borders\f28 \uc2 \f2  hospital in a weekend airstrike and that the U.S. would never intentionally target a medical facility. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ECB OFFICIALS TO RESTRICT SPEECH CONTENT TO PUBLICLY ACCESSIBLE INFORMATION \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said members of its executive board will restrict their market-sensitive remarks to material that is accessible to the public. \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 SOUTH AFRICA CENTRAL BANK\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  CHIEF SEES NO POINT IN \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -MARKET \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENTION\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 The rand has hit record-low levels, but South African Reserve Bank Gov. Lesetja Kganyago says that "no \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , no matter how much reserves it has, can take on the market and stem the depreciation of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ." \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TOYOTA\f28 \uc2 \f2  AIMS TO MAKE SELF-DRIVING CARS BY 2020 \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Toyota Motor Corp\f28 \uc2 \f2 . plans to make some of its cars fully capable of self-driving on highways by around 2020, it said Tuesday, accelerating the rollout of its autonomous-drive technology and countering Silicon Valley rivals like \f28 \uc2 \f2 Google Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par AIR FRANCE TO REPLACE HUMAN RESOURCES CHIEF \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Air France\f28 \uc2 \f2  is preparing to replace a chief labor negotiator, a day after workers tore off his clothes amid contentious talks over restructuring the money-losing airline. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par RUSSIA GIVES \f28 \uc2 \f2 GOOGLE\f28 \uc2 \f2  A MONTH TO RECTIFY ANTITRUST BREACHES \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Russia's antimonopoly watchdog has ordered \f28 \uc2 \f2 Google Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 . to rectify its antitrust law violations, potentially paving the way for a hefty fine and helping local search engine \f28 \uc2 \f2 Yandex NV\f28 \uc2 \f2 . \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par SKYWORKS TO BUY PMC-SIERRA \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Chip company \f28 \uc2 \f2 Skyworks Solutions\f28 \uc2 \f2  agreed to buy \f28 \uc2 \f2 PMC-Sierra\f28 \uc2 \f2  in a $2 billion deal aimed at boosting its position in the big data market. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 AMERISOURCEBERGEN\f28 \uc2 \f2  TO BUY PHARMEDIUM HEALTHCARE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Drug wholesaler \f28 \uc2 \f2 AmerisourceBergen\f28 \uc2 \f2  said it has agreed to acquire \f28 \uc2 \f2 PharMEDium Healthcare Holdings\f28 \uc2 \f2 , a privately-held provider of personalized medications to hospitals, in an all-cash deal worth $2.58 billion. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ACTIVIST INVESTOR VALUEACT HINTS AT PLANS FOR \f28 \uc2 \f2 BAKER HUGHES\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 ValueAct on Tuesday hinted at its intentions for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Baker Hughes\f28 \uc2 \f2 , which is awaiting regulatory approval for a tie-up with \f28 \uc2 \f2 Halliburton\f28 \uc2 \f2 , after the activist investor took a roughly 5% stake in the oil-field servicer earlier this year. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par  \par   ======= DOW JONES NEWSWIRES ANALYSIS AND COMMENTARIES ======= \par  \par  \par Technology \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 MICROSOFT\f28 \uc2 \f2  UNVEILS NEW SMARTPHONES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Microsoft\f28 \uc2 \f2  announced Tuesday two new smartphones of its own design and running Windows software, in the company's latest bid to revive its struggling mobile-phone business. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Moneybeat Blog \par FOR THE JOBS MARKET, 100,000 MAY BE THE NEW 200,000 \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 After two months of disappointing gains in nonfarm payrolls -- with August adding 136,000 net jobs and September adding 142,000 -- some economists are raising the possibility that the days of 200,000-plus pace hiring are over. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 October 06, 2015 13:00 ET (17:00 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020151006eba6002ds\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
