\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Rand hits 5-year low on PMI, rouble edges off lows\b0\par\par\uc2 559 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 2014\par 12:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2014 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 LONDON, Jan 15 (Reuters) - South Africa's rand hit a five-year low against the dollar on Wednesday after data indicated contraction in the manufacturing sector, while the rouble recovered slightly from 4-1/2 year lows hit this week on a cut in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2 's purchasing managers' index ended 2013 at 49.9, below the 50 level that denotes expansion and its weakest level in eight months.\par \par \uc2 South Africa is one of the "Fragile Five" deficit economies hit hard by expectations of a reduction in the U.S. bond-buying programme that had fuelled demand for higher-yielding assets.\par \par \uc2 "The key story is that nothing changed over Christmas to alter investors' framework, they are still worried about the Fragile Five," said Charles Robertson, chief economist at Renaissance Capital.\par \par \uc2 "For investors to change their view ... you would need to see a better current account outlook and/or improved GDP figures."\par \par \uc2 The rand fell more than 1 percent to five-year lows close to 11 per dollar. South African stocks rallied more than 1 percent, however, with Massmart climbing 5 percent following a positive trading statement.\par \par \uc2 The MSCI emerging equities index edged up 0.2 percent after the \uc2 World Bank\uc2  raised its growth forecasts for the global economy for the first time in three years.\par \par \uc2 But the \uc2 World Bank\uc2  cut its 2014 growth forecast for emerging markets to 5.3 from 5.6 percent seen in June and warned of the risk of sudden changes in interest rates.\par \par \uc2 "Abrupt changes in market expectations, resulting in global bond yields increasing by 100 to 200 basis points within a couple of quarters, could lead to a sharp reduction in capital inflows to developing countries by between 50 and 80 percent for several months," it said.\par \par \uc2 ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.worldbank.org/en/publication/global-economic-prospects"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.worldbank.org/en/publication/global-economic-prospects}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 The rouble hit four-month lows against the dollar for a second day but recovered slightly from 4-1/2 year lows hit against its dollar-euro basket after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said this week it would scale back \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no exchange rate target and is shifting towards a free float of the rouble to insulate the economy from volatility on global markets, First Deputy Chairwoman Ksenia Yudayeva said on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Russia's neighbours were also weak - the Ukrainian hryvnia tested four-year lows and the Kazakh tenge hit its lowest in 11 years.\par \par \uc2 Emerging sovereign debt spreads inched in by 1 basis point to 345 bps over U.S. Treasuries.\par \par \uc2 Emerging European sovereign borrowers have been dashing to raise money in international markets this month.\par \par \uc2 Following 10- and 30-year dollar bonds from Romania this week, Serbia said on Tuesday it will issue a 600 million euro bond this year.\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging index performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/weh36s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/weh36s}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI emerging Europe performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/jun28s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/jun28s}}}\par \par \uc2 For GRAPHIC on MSCI frontier index performance 2014, see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://link.reuters.com/zyh97s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://link.reuters.com/zyh97s}}}\par \par \uc2 For CENTRAL EUROPE market report, see\par \par \uc2 For TURKISH market report, see\par \par \uc2 For RUSSIAN market report, see ) (Reporting by Carolyn Cohn and Natsuko Waki, editing by Louise Heavens)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-EMERGING | ABN | E | RBN | D | M | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020140118ea1f0004q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
