\par\par \b \uc2 South African Rand Continues to Weaken but Forint Gains\b0\par\par\uc2 By Prabha Natarajan   \par \uc2 544 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2013\par 19:32\par \uc2 Dow Jones Global Equities News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2013 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The South African rand and the Hungarian forint were once again the leaders on the board Wednesday. The rand depreciated by nearly 1% during the day while, unexpectedly, the Hungarian forint gained after several sessions of weakness.\par \par \uc2 In a day when several emerging economies' \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chiefs talked policy, there was no clear pattern of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves. But there is a growing sense that central banks may be gearing up for action if their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuation continues. The Hungarian forint gained some ground after the vice governor of the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  called the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's slide "unwelcome".\par \par \uc2 "The recent exchange rate fluctuations are not justified by fundamentals and unwelcome for Hungary's economy," Adam Balog said in his first press comments since his appointment last week.\par \par \uc2 The euro rose to HUF307.29 on Wednesday, initially, hitting its highest level since January 2012. Traders and investors were shook up after recent changes by the new \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor and worried that he would pursue further monetary policy easing despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakness.\par \par \uc2 Still, some buyers have ventured back into the forint trade, betting that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would use tools at its disposal to reverse the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's weakness. The forint retraced and now has notched a 0.75% gain on the day at HUF304.23 to the euro, according to CQG data.\par \par \uc2 However, no such knights rode to the rescue of the rand.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to come under pressure and weakened to ZAR9.26to the dollar, a low for the period going back to April 2009. \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , typically, has refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Most market participants expect them to continue this policy through the current volatility. The rand, currently, is trading at ZAR9.2292, down 0.65% on the day.\par \par \uc2 Standard & Poor's\uc2  reaffirmed its rating on South Africa's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds but maintained its negative outlook warning that it could lower the rating if the country's economic gloom persisted. Esther Law, analyst at \uc2 Societe Generale\uc2  says, that S&P is the only agency that has a single A rating on South Africa's local government bonds. If the agency were to downgrade, then it would force a lot of portfolio managers to sell their positions due to rating restrictions, she said.\par \par \uc2 "The threat is real and will result in some outflows, which will be bad to both local and \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets," she said.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, ahead of the Indian rate-setting meeting this week, Reserve Bank of India governor indicated that inflation continues to be the bank's focus, and a reading above 6% demands tight policy. Market participants had been expecting more easing by the bank this week, but his comments may raise some concerns about further easing.\par \par \uc2 The dollar gained nearly 0.5% on the day to INR54.39, according to CQG data.\par \par \uc2 In such a world of changing expectations, the Mexican peso continued to find favor with investors. The peso gained 0.4% on the day as investors added to their long positions in this \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 --Margit Feher and \uc2 Sudeep Jain\uc2  contributed to this report.\par \par \uc2 -Write to Prabha Natarajan at prabha.natarajan@dowjones.com [ 13-03-13 1832GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020130313e93d000tg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
