\par\par \b \uc2 S.Africa rand at 3-week lows, bonds also fall\b0\par\par\uc2 386 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Juni 2012\par 18:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * Euro, weak trade stats weigh on rand\par \par \uc2 * Rand vulnerable as Reserve Bank won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 JOHANNESBURG, June 25 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rand fell as much as 1.4 percent on Monday to a three-week low against the dollar as uncertainty over euro zone debt undermined global investors' demand for riskier emerging market assets.\par \par \uc2 Government debt also weakened, pushing the yield on the benchmark three-year bond up 6 basis points to 6.08 percent, pulling back further from a record low of 5.97 percent hit last week.\par \par \uc2 The longer-dated 2026 paper fell more heavily, with its yield rising nearly 10 basis points to 8.095 percent.\par \par \uc2 The rand, one of the most heavily traded and freely floating of emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , was at 8.5015 at 1505 GMT, its third straight session on the back foot as the euro, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of South Africa's biggest trading partner, fell against the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Doubts over whether a European summit later this week will make any headway in resolving the bloc's debt crisis weighed on the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and by extension emerging market assets.\par \par \uc2 "The rand is reacting in a normal way to the euro falling," said Murat Toprak, a regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 HSBC\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "But underperformance of the rand is more than usual, because when you look at the other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  within the Europe, Middle East and Africa region, the magnitude of the weakness is not that big."\par \par \uc2 Turkey's lira, for instance, was only 0.5 percent weaker after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  by tightening liquidity after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell on concerns about escalating political tension with Syria after the shooting down of a Turkish war plane.\par \par \uc2 A wider South African current account deficit revealed last week as a result of a slowdown in exports are also weighing on the rand.\par \par \uc2 The Reserve Bank publishes its business cycle indicator for April on Tuesday and producer price, money supply and May trade figures are due later in the week - all of them likely to be closely watched for signs of the health of Africa's biggest economy.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Stella Mapenzauswa; Editing by Ed Cropley, Ron Askew)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-SAFRICA/RAND | AFN | ABN | D | M | RBN | SF | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120628e86p0013t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
