\par\par \b \uc2 SAfrica's cbank says costly to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  volatility-FT\b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Mai 2012\par 00:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2012 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 JOHANNESBURG, May 3 (Reuters) - South African \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Gill Marcus said on Thursday it would be costly to fight the volatility of the rand through direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Emerging markets are seeing greater exchange rate volatility as near-zero interest rates in developed economies lead investors to seek yields in riskier but higher yielding assets.\par \par \uc2 "So what can be done? Direct \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is one option," Marcus said in an opinion piece published by the Financial Times.\par \par \uc2 "(But) with average daily turnover in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market of about $16 billion, trying to lean against \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves would require a lot of costly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2 's gross foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and gold reserves -- which would provide some of the firepower needed to reduce rand volatility -- stood at nearly $50 billion at the end of March.\par \par \uc2 Marcus also said lowering interest rates was not an option because the inflation rate was already too high in Africa's biggest economy.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  targets inflation of between 3 and 6 percent. Headline consumer inflation slowed to 6 percent in March, returning to the target band for the first time since November.\par \par \uc2 The rand gained about 30 percent on the dollar between 2009 and 2010 but lost about the same amount between August and November last year when it tumbled to a two-year low.\par \par \uc2 (Reporting by Tiisetso Motsoeneng; Editing by Myra MacDonald)\par \par \uc2 SAFRICA-MARCUS/ | AFN | ABN | M | SF | DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020120503e853001im\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
