\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-S.Africa's  \highlight22\uc2 fx \highlight\uc2  reserves rise at mild pace in Sept\b0\par\par\uc2 457 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 2010\par 08:14\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  * Data suggests \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  not aggressive\par \par \uc2  * Rand remains near 2-1/2 year highs against dollar\par \par \uc2    (Adds comment, market reaction, background)\par \par \uc2  JOHANNESBURG, Oct 7 (Reuters) - South Africa's foreign reserves rose in September at a pace suggesting \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not aggressive despite strong gains in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a phenomenon some emerging markets have been fighting more actively.\par \par \uc2  The rand has gained more than 28 percent against the dollar since the start of 2009 and more than 7 percent since the beginning of this year, prompting calls from labour unions for the authorities to step in more forcefully to weaken it.\par \par \uc2  The data showed the \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2  Reserve Bank's (SARB)  \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appreciation remained "relatively benign" against more aggressive action by other central banks, said Razia Khan, regional head of research for Africa at Standard Chartered.\par \par \uc2  Net gold and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves increased to $40.854 billion at the end of September from $39.178 billion in August, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in a statement posted on its website.\par \par \uc2  "In all, (it's a) disappointing \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves release from South Africa, with the forward position -- which now reflects how much the SARB has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  ... rising only $618 million," Khan said.\par \par \uc2  Rising tensions between emerging and developed economies over exchange rates are expected to be a hot topic at Group of Seven and International Monetary Fund meetings starting on Friday in Washington. [ID:nSGE69601R]\par \par \uc2  Gross reserves rose to $44.069 billion from $43.133 billion the previous month, while foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves went up $560 million to $36.025 billion. Gold reserves increased by $299 million to $5.268 billion.\par \par \uc2  "South Africa's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves will rise gradually over time, but for the market, the lack of a more aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 interventionist\b0 \highlight\uc2  stance by the SARB is likely to be seen as the green light to take dollar/rand lower," Khan said.\par \par \uc2  The rand <ZAR=D3> hovered near 2-1/2 year highs against the greenback on Thursday, and was last at 6.8450 compared with 6.8520 before release of the data at 0600 GMT. The yield on the benchmark 2015 note <ZAR157=> was unchanged at 7.29 percent.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  however says it does not target a level for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , saying it should be determined by the market.\par \par \uc2  The bank has steadily lifted reserves over the past five years after it brought a long-standing negative position into balance in 2004, but gross reserves still lag emerging market peers.  (Reporting by Stella Mapenzauswa; Editing by Hugh Lawson)     \par \par \uc2 SAFRICA-RESERVES/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|SF|AFN|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101007e6a7000h8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
