\par\par \b \uc2 S.Africa's Mboweni repeats won't  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  on rand.  \b0\par\par\uc2 350 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 November 2004\par 09:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 JOHANNESBURG, Nov 24 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not step up the pace of its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases to stem the appreciation of the rand \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , governor Tito Mboweni has repeated in an interview.  \par \par \uc2 "We are accumulating reserves at a measured pace. We do not aggressively go into the market and demand dollars. That would be tantamount to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he told Bloomberg in an interview in London on Tuesday.  \par \par \uc2 The rand firmed by about two cents to 5.960 versus the dollar at 0830 GMT, but traders said that the unit was responding to the dollar's retreat to a new record low against the euro , the unit of South Africa's main trade partner.  \par \par \uc2 Officials from the South African Reserve Bank have repeatedly said that the bank will buy \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  to build its relatively low level of international reserves cautiously, to avoid affecting the value of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 The rand has appreciated by about 12 percent against the dollar so far this year, in a trend which has taken a rising toll on domestic exports and corporate profits and stemmed mounting calls for official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "We cream off excess dollars in the market, with no intention whatsoever of affecting any particular level of the exchange rate, but only with the purpose of building reserves as and when those market conditions allow us," Mboweni said.  \par \par \uc2 South Africa's gross reserves have climbed to more than $13 billion - taking the increase over the past year to about $5.2 billion. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it will continue to build its reserves arsenal but not disclosed a specific target.  \par \par \uc2 "At some point we may have to slow down the accumulation of reserves," Mboweni said.  \par \par \uc2 He declined to say whether the bank would decrease its holding of dollars in favor of other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in anticipation of further dollar weakness, and did not disclose its overall proportion the greenback has in its reserves.  \par \par \uc2 "We balance the portfolio from time to time. We don't make any big noise about it."   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020041124e0bo0076d\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
