\par\par \b \uc2  S.Africa rand edges weaker on euro,bonds follow. \b0\par\par\uc2 299 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 November 2000\par 16:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JOHANNESBURG, Nov 3 (Reuters) - The South African rand was trending softer in late trade on Friday, tracking the euro's dip back below $0.8700, after briefly strengthening in response to European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (ECB) \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The ECB's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed the euro - the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 South Africa\b0 \highlight\uc2 's main trading partners - to one-month highs near $0.88. \par \par \uc2  However, the rand failed to take advantage of the rising euro, with players concentrating on covering short dollar positions. \par \par \uc2  Traders said market scepticism over the euro's gains and disppointment over the rand's failure to break the key 7.48 level the previous day had limited the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reponse to the ECB \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier. \par \par \uc2  Chartists reckon a break below 7.48 would have signalled further gains for the bruised rand. \par \par \uc2  By 1445 GMT the rand was bid at 7.5350/7.5450 to the dollar, but off its intraday weakest level of level 7.5650. The rand ended Thursday at 7.53. \par \par \uc2  "The market is a bit short of dollars and we have seen dollar demand out of London," said trader. \par \par \uc2  Against the euro the rand slipped to 6.5170 versus 6.4662 in late trade on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The weakness in the rand took some edge of the bullish bond market with the yield on the five year benchmark R150 government bond rising to 12.70 percent from a session best level of 12.60 percent. \par \par \uc2  "The mid-60s is a key resistance level as the market has attempted to break through this level and failed three times since August. Today there have been two unsuccessful attempts," said Barclays Capital in afternoon notes. \par \par \uc2  For related prices and news Also see the emerging market speed guide by double-clicking on . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010822dwb302uj9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
